            "id": "4953253",
            "title": "What Moved Markets This Week",
            "description": "<html><body><div class=\"wsb_wrapper\"> <div class=\"wsb_main\"><span><p data-eci=\"true\"><strong>Listen on the go! A daily podcast of Wall Street Breakfast will be available by 8:00 a.m. on <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/author/wall-street-breakfast?utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_medium=toptext&amp;utm_campaign=wsbpodpromo\">Seeking Alpha</a>, <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/wall-street-breakfast/id1358381502\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">iTunes</a>, <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/05uLjJxkVgQsRk8LWLCLpx\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Spotify</a>.</strong></p></span></div> <figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture><img alt=\"\" data-id=\"2290055159\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2290055159/image_2290055159.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" width=\"100%\"/><figcaption><p class=\"item-credits\">Douglas Rissing/iStock via Getty Images</p></figcaption></picture></figure>\n<p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\"></p> <p><span class=\"b italic\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">Up for a challenge? Test your knowledge on the biggest events in the investing world over the past week. Take the latest <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/quiz/72-investment-news-quiz-friday-oct-9-2026-10-09\">Seeking Alpha News Quiz</a> and see how you stack up against the competition.</span></p> <p></p> <h2></h2> <p></p> <p><br/>Wall Street ended the trading week higher, as the Federal Reserve's meeting minutes reaffirmed a hawkish stance, a massive SpaceX (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SPCX\" title=\"Space Exploration Technologies Corp.\">SPCX</a>) deal rattled telecom stocks, and AI infrastructure players faced fresh scrutiny over revenue expectations.</p> <p>The Federal Open Market Committee's September meeting minutes revealed united support for the central bank's tightening cycle, with officials highlighting upside risks to inflation and cementing market expectations for<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4651107-most-fed-officials-saw-another-rate-hike-as-likely-fomc-minutes\" target=\"_blank\"> prolonged higher rates. </a><br/><br/>SpaceX’s (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SPCX\" title=\"Space Exploration Technologies Corp.\">SPCX</a>) $8B deal to buy a nationwide low-band spectrum portfolio from Grain Management sparked a selloff in <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4651639-telecom-stocks-drop-as-spacex-acquires-spectrum-for-starlink\" target=\"_blank\">major telecom stocks</a>, like AT&amp;T (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/T\" title=\"AT&amp;T Inc.\">T</a>) and Verizon (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/VZ\" title=\"Verizon Communications Inc.\">VZ</a>).<br/><br/>The broader AI sector faced a reality check after OpenAI (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/OPENAI\" title=\"OpenAI\">OPENAI</a>) revised its annualized revenue expectations downward, triggering heavy investor scrutiny over the sustainability of massive <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4651482-oracle-microsoft-shares-decline-as-openais-arr-called-into-question\" target=\"_blank\">infrastructure capital expenditures. </a><br/><br/>For the week ended Oct. 9, the blue-chip Dow (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/DJI\" title=\"Dow Jones Industrial Average Index\">DJI</a>) rose <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+0.9%</span>, the benchmark S&amp;P (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SP500\">SP500</a>) gained <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+1.2%</span>, and the tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/COMP:IND\" title=\"NASDAQ Composite Index\">COMP:IND</a>) increased <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+0.6%</span>.<br/><br/>Read a preview of next week's major events in <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4651405-catalyst-watch-big-bank-earnings-cpi-and-the-paris-auto-show\" target=\"_blank\">Seeking Alpha's Catalyst Watch</a>.<br/><br/></p> <p></p> <h2><a class=\"!no-underline !text-share-text\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4651349-confidence-in-food-safety-at-new-low\">Low confidence</a></h2> <p>Americans' confidence in food safety has dropped to a new low, a recent Gallup survey showed, and they are less confident in the federal government's oversight of food supply as well. The findings come as headlines on food recalls keep popping up, while this year saw an significant rise in foodborne illnesses. Consumer concerns were also reflected in restaurant foot traffic. <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4651349-confidence-in-food-safety-at-new-low\"><span class=\"b\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Read more.</span></a></p> <p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\">Seeking Alpha's Calls Of The Week</p> <p>McDonald's (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MCD\" title=\"McDonald's Corporation\">MCD</a>): Same-Store Sales Are <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4952688-mcdonalds-same-store-sales-are-an-overrated-metric-upgrade\">An Overrated Metric</a>.<br/><br/>Fed Policy Shift <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4952541-bank-of-america-fed-policy-shift-creates-nii-upside-rating-upgrade\">Creates NII Upside</a> For Bank of America (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/BAC\" title=\"Bank of America Corporation\">BAC</a>).<br/><br/>Oshkosh (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/OSK\" title=\"Oshkosh Corporation\">OSK</a>) Is A Strong Buy Despite <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4951847-oshkosh-strong-buy-upgrade-despite-execution-challenges\">Execution Challenges</a>.<br/><br/>AST SpaceMobile (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ASTS\" title=\"AST SpaceMobile, Inc.\">ASTS</a>): <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4952291-ast-spacemobile-cheaper-and-better-than-spacex-upgrade\">Cheaper, Better Than</a> SpaceX (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SPCX\" title=\"Space Exploration Technologies Corp.\">SPCX</a>).<br/><br/>L3Harris (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/LHX\" title=\"L3Harris Technologies, Inc.\">LHX</a>): Attractive Entry Into Global <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4952738-l3harris-an-attractive-entry-into-the-global-rearmament-cycle-rating-upgrade\">Rearmament Cycle</a>.<br/><br/>NIO (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NIO\" title=\"NIO Inc.\">NIO</a>): Weakness In China's Consumer <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4952508-nio-china-consumer-market-weakness-deepens-rating-downgrade\">Market Deepens</a>.<br/><br/>Blue Owl Capital (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/OBDC\" title=\"Blue Owl Capital Corporation\">OBDC</a>): Market Bracing For <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4952042-blue-owl-capital-market-bracing-for-a-dividend-cut-downgrade\">A Dividend Cut</a>.<br/><br/>Where Does Costco (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/COST\" title=\"Costco Wholesale Corporation\">COST</a>) Go From Here? <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4951640-costco-where-does-the-stock-go-from-here-i-say-nowhere-rating-downgrade\">I Say Nowhere</a>.<br/><br/>Permian Resources (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/PR\" title=\"Permian Resources Corporation\">PR</a>) Shares Are <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4952703-permian-resources-more-than-fully-valued-time-to-cash-out-downgrade\">More Than Fully Valued</a>.<br/><br/><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4952520-time-to-de-risk-why-were-selling-nmai-in-favor-of-aor-rating-downgrade\">Time To De-Risk</a> - Why We're Selling <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NMAI\" title=\"Nuveen Multi-Asset Income Fund\">NMAI</a> In Favor Of <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/AOR\" title=\"iShares Core 60/40 Balanced Allocation ETF\">AOR</a>.<br/></p> <p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\">Weekly Movement</p> <p></p> <p><span style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; margin-top: 0px !important; padding: 5px 0 0;\"><strong>U.S. Indices</strong><br/>Dow <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+0.9%</span> to 51,655. S&amp;P 500 <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+1.2%</span> to 7,812. Nasdaq <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+0.6%</span> to 27,366. Russell 2000 <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-0.9%</span> to 2,807. CBOE Volatility Index <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-3.1%</span> to 14.84. <br/><br/><strong>S&amp;P 500 Sectors</strong><br/>Consumer Staples <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+4%</span>. Utilities <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+3.9%</span>. Financials <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+2.3%</span>. Telecom <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+0.8%</span>. Healthcare <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+2.8%</span>. Industrials <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-0.4%</span>. Information Technology <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-0.3%</span>. Materials <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+1.4%</span>. Energy <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+3.6%</span>. Consumer Discretionary <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+3.1%</span>. Real Estate <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+1.8%</span>. <br/><br/><strong>World Indices</strong><br/>London <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+0.9%</span> to 10,552. France <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-1.2%</span> to 7,803. Germany <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-0.6%</span> to 25,087. Japan <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+1.1%</span> to 69,031. China <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-0.7%</span> to 3,814. Hong Kong <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+1%</span> to 24,211. India <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+0.8%</span> to 72,472. <br/><br/><strong>Commodities and Bonds</strong><br/>Crude Oil WTI <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+0.6%</span> to $91.66/bbl. Gold <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+1.4%</span> to $4,220.3/oz. Natural Gas <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+5.4%</span> to 3.2. Ten-Year Bond Yield -0.2 bps to 5.244. <br/><br/><strong>Forex and Cryptos</strong><br/>EUR/USD <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-0.46%</span>. USD/JPY <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+0.3%</span>. GBP/USD <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-0.08%</span>. Bitcoin <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-2.3%</span>. Litecoin <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-9.1%</span>. Ethereum <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-7%</span>. XRP <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-5%</span>. <br/><br/><strong>Top S&amp;P 500 Gainers</strong><br/>PTC (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/PTC\" title=\"PTC Inc.\">PTC</a>) <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+35%</span>. Crown Castle (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CCI\" title=\"Crown Castle Inc.\">CCI</a>) <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+20%</span>. Moderna (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MRNA\" title=\"Moderna, Inc.\">MRNA</a>) <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+18%</span>. Constellation Energy (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CEG\" title=\"Constellation Energy Corporation\">CEG</a>) <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+16%</span>. Vistra (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/VST\" title=\"Vistra Corp.\">VST</a>) <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+15%</span>. <br/><br/><strong>Top S&amp;P 500 Losers</strong><br/>Intel (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/INTC\" title=\"Intel Corporation\">INTC</a>) <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-12%</span>. The Mosaic (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MOS\" title=\"The Mosaic Company\">MOS</a>) <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-11%</span>. Teradyne (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/TER\" title=\"Teradyne, Inc.\">TER</a>) <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-10%</span>. Skyworks Solutions (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SWKS\" title=\"Skyworks Solutions, Inc.\">SWKS</a>) <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-10%</span>. C.H. Robinson Worldwide (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CHRW\" title=\"C.H. Robinson Worldwide, Inc.\">CHRW</a>) <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-10%</span>. <br/><br/><i>Where will the markets be headed next week? Current trends and ideas? Add your thoughts <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4953253-what-moved-markets-this-week#scroll_comments\">to the comments section.</a></i></span></p> </div></body></html>",
